# AI Resume Screening System with Tracing

## Objective
Build an AI-powered Resume Screening System using LangChain pipeline design and LangSmith tracing.

## Pipeline
Resume → Extract → Match → Score → Explain

## Features
- Skill extraction
- Matching logic
- Candidate scoring (0–100)
- Explainable output
- LangSmith tracing
- Debugging example

## LangChain Concepts Used
- PromptTemplate
- LCEL
- RunnableLambda
- .invoke()

## Tracing
LangSmith tracing enabled through environment variables.

## Candidates Tested
- Strong candidate
- Average candidate
- Weak candidate
